      "id": "t1",
      "instruction": "Required solver: OpenSees.\nUse OpenSees to analyze a single-bay industrial frame with span 24 m, roof height 12 m and both column bases fixed. Case D applies global downward 36 kN/m over the roof and one crane-equivalent nodal force at the right column top with Fx = +10 kN and Fz = -98 kN. The 36 kN/m line load is already converted from a 1.5 kN/m² source roof pressure over 24 m tributary width. Report ux, uz and ry at both column tops and at the connected roof midpoint (x = 12 m, z = 12 m), Fx, Fz and My at both bases, and M2 at both ends of the right column. Use the full properties and member directions in the public appendix.\n\nUse all public appendices. Report the complete requested numerical table and the required summaries.",
      "state": 1,
      "expectation": "analyze",
